{
  "name": "Blood Sacrifice",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you take a Short Rest and use your Arcane Recovery class feature, you can spend a number of hit dice up to equal to your Proficiency modifier.</p><p>The number of hit dice spent in this manner is added to the total level of spell slots that you can recover with Arcane Recovery.</p><p>Additionally, when a creature of at least CR 1/8 afflicted with the Lacerated condition from one of your spells dies within 120 feet of you, you regain one hit die.</p>",
